
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>MCFont</title>

    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Roboto:ital,wght@0,100..900;1,100..900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/public/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
    <h1>MCFont</h1>
    <p>a Simple way to display Minecraft Text on your GitHub profile.</p>
    <details>
        <summary>Code reference</summary>
        <table>
            <tr>
                <td><code>&0</code> - <code>&f</code></td>
                <td>Minecraft Colors</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><code>&#ff0000</code></td>
                <td>Custom HEX Colors</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><code>&l</code></td>
                <td>Bold</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><code>&o</code></td>
                <td>Italic</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><code>&n</code></td>
                <td>Underline</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><code>&m</code></td>
                <td>Strikethrough</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><code>&k</code></td>
                <td>Obfuscated</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><code>&s</code> / <code>&s#ff0000</code></td>
                <td>Shadow, optionally with a color</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><code>&g</code> / <code>&g#ff0000</code></td>
                <td>Glow, optionally with a color</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><code>&r</code></td>
                <td>Reset</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><code>&&</code></td>
                <td>a Literal & symbol</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><code>\n</code></td>
                <td>New line</td>
            </tr>
        </table>
    </details>


    <div class="tools">

    </div>

    <div class="colors">

    </div>

    <textarea name="text" id="text" placeholder="Hello, world!"></textarea>

    <div class="output">
        <img src="" alt="" id="imgOutput">
    </div>

    <div class="outputs">
        <div>
            <input type="text" id="url" readonly>
            <button>Copy</button>
        </div>
        <div>
            <input type="text" id="md" readonly>
            <button>Copy</button>
        </div>
        <div>
            <input type="text" id="html" readonly>
            <button>Copy</button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <p>NOT AN OFFICIAL MINECRAFT SERVICE. NOT APPROVED BY OR ASSOCIATED WITH MOJANG OR MICROSOFT</p>
</body>
</html>